msgid ""
"Your secret service provider was found, but refused to interact with "
"Tonearm.\n"
"\n"
"This could because you cancelled a prompt or, if you are using a Flatpak, "
"the provider not implementing the XDG Secret Portal service.\n"
"\n"
"Tonearm will not be able to store any authentication-related data and you "
"will not be able to sign in."
msgstr ""
"Se encontró su proveedor de servicio de secretos, pero rechazó interactuar "
"con Tonearm.\n"
"\n"
"Esto puede deberse a que canceló un mensaje o, si está usando Flatpak, a que "
"el proveedor no implementa el servicio XDG Secret Portal.\n"
"\n"
"Tonearm no podrá almacenar datos relacionados con la autenticación y no "
"podrá iniciar sesión."

